    "detailed_description": "Hot Topics<br />\r\nWho doesn't want to have an exciting relationship with a beautiful coworker in the office? Opening a desk, from the most junior intern all the way back, promotion! Salary increase! Hold a beautiful woman! As long as the player wants, everything can be realized!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeautiful Colleagues<br />\r\nYoung girl, neighboring sister, iceberg beauty, charming royal sister, arrogant Qianjin, one time to participate in the different life of five beautiful women. Athlete, childhood friendship, happy enemies, play, a time to feel five different love experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMulti-branch plot ending<br />\r\nEach of the five heroines has an independent story line, with up to 14 different endings. Each heroine has a secret waiting to be discovered by the player, and the player can participate in their lives and dominate their destinies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVersatile gameplay<br />\r\nThe collection system and various QTE gameplay make the game full of fun. Collecting important items and clues will open up unexpected storylines, and a variety of QTE gameplay and mini-game mechanics bring a rich gameplay experience, allowing players to win the heart of the heroine with their strength.",
